{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49498","headline":"虞美人 三 · 顾敻","name":"虞美人 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠屏闲掩垂珠箔，丝雨笼池阁。\n露黏红藕咽清香，谢娘娇极不成狂，罢朝妆。\n小金鸂鶒沈烟细，腻枕堆云髻。\n浅眉微歛注檀轻，旧欢时有梦魂惊，悔多情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}